      en: ["The official opening took place in May 2019.", "The stadium cost approximately 12 million euros to build.", "It features a certified professional athletics track.", "The pitch consists of high-quality natural grass.", "Malouzini is located about 5 kilometers from Moroni's city center.", "The national team has maintained a strong unbeaten record here in home matches."],
      es: ["Inaugurado en 1995", "Capacidad: 5.000 asientos", "Longitud de la pista de atletismo: 400 metros", "Estadio local de la selección de fútbol de las Comoras", "Situado a 10 km al sur de Moroni", "Altitud sobre el nivel del mar: 20 metros"],
      pt: ["Inaugurado em 1995", "Capacidade: 5.000 lugares", "Comprimento da pista de atletismo: 400 metros", "Estádio da seleção nacional de futebol das Comores", "Localizado a 10 km a sul de Moroni", "Altitude acima do nível do mar: 20 metros"],
      fr: ["Inauguré en 1995", "Capacité : 5 000 places assises", "Longueur de la piste d'athlétisme : 400 mètres", "Stade de l'équipe nationale de football des Comores", "Situé à 10 km au sud de Moroni", "Altitude au-dessus du niveau de la mer : 20 mètres"],
